{"passage": "The solar system consists of the Sun and eight planets, including Earth and Mars. Mercury is the closest planet to the Sun and has extreme temperature variations. It takes about 88 Earth days for Mercury to orbit the Sun once.", "question": "How long does it take for Mercury to orbit the Sun?", "answers": [{"text": "88 Earth days", "label": 1}, {"text": "365 Earth days", "label": 0}, {"text": "24 hours", "label": 0}]}
